    "source": "",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A small round buckler stamped from sheet steel and laced to a leather forearm cuff. Faction-pressed in batches of a thousand and handed out to whoever could close their fingers around the grip. Half ward, half noisemaker — the dent in the front is where someone else's mistake stopped.</p><p>Pairs with any one-handed weapon. No signature, no attunement, no apologies for the dent.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Armor:</strong> Shield</li>\n  <li><strong>Defense:</strong> Guard +1</li>\n  <li><strong>Requires:</strong> Bracing (trained)</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> II</li>\n  <li><strong>Cost:</strong> 210 Nonlethal marks</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Bound Working — Mutual Aid Clause (TI).</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Carries the Working <strong>Mutual Aid Clause</strong>: it appears among your Manifestations as “Mutual Aid Clause ⟡ Pressed Buckler of Mutual Aid” and casts from the item, <strong>no Clarity</strong> — Noise and misfire still apply.</li>\n  <li><strong>3 charges</strong>; one is spent per cast attempt; all recover on a Soma Break.</li>\n  <li><em>One ally within 6 squares immediately gains Guard +2 for 1 round as the neighborhood arrives.</em></li>\n  <li>Tier II · attuned (one slot) · technomagical (Witness-forge binding).</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->",
      "chat": ""
    }
  },
